{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年6月30日 17:04 星期二</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>位於本港以南的雷雨區正逐漸向北移動，預料會在未來一兩小時影響本港。市民請留意天氣變化。 （天文台）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-30T09:38:31.934752+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"unknown"}}